  "notes": "Sprint 136 T-007 ErrorRegistry Lint Rule retrospective tamamlandı.\n\n## Bulgular\n\n1. **lint:errors invoke**: `npm run lint:errors` exit 0 — 82 dosya tarandı, 0 ihlal bulundu. Script package.json satır 30'da `node scripts/check-error-handling.mjs` olarak doğrulandı.\n\n2. **Pattern match**: `scanFile()` fonksiyonu `throw new Error(` desenini doğru tespit ediyor. `DeckentError`, `TypeError` vb. false positive üretmiyor.\n\n3. **ErrorRegistry export**: `src/core/errors.ts` → `export const ErrorRegistry`, `export class DeckentError`, `register()` ve `createError()` metodları mevcut ve çalışıyor.\n\n4. **Sprint 135 N2 debt**: `ipc-registry.ts` 270 LoC canlı, `askBrain()` export var — MEMORY.md'de bu borç kapatıldı olarak işaretlenmiş.\n\n## Yazılan Testler (31 adet)\n\n- `lint:errors — npm run invoke`: 3 test (package.json script, exit 0, script file exists)\n- `scanFile — pattern match`: 7 test (violation detect, multi-violation, clean file, DeckentError no-flag, TypeError no-flag, line number, empty file)\n- `collectTsFiles — directory traversal`: 6 test (flat dir, recursive, node_modules exclude, dist exclude, nonexistent dir, empty dir)\n- `runCheck — full scan`: 4 test (actual project 0 violations, filesScanned positive, mock root violation, mock root clean)\n- `formatViolations — output formatting`: 6 test (empty string, count header, relative path, line number, suggested fix, multiple violations)\n- `ErrorRegistry — export presence`: 5 test (ErrorRegistry export, DeckentError export, register method, createError method, no raw throw new Error)\n\n## Baseline vs End State\n\nBaseline: `tests/core/errors.test.ts` mevcut (43 test) — script testleri YOK\nEnd state: `tests/core/error-registry-lint.test.ts` eklendi (31 yeni test)\nDelta: Task spec 3+ test → 31 test yazıldı (%100 aşıldı)",
